OL,3,GNEWSAClassroom 'safe to use' after
OL,4,Amould removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FTests have shown a classroom is clear
OL,7,Fof mould after remedial works were
OL,8,Fcompleted.
OL,10,FIndependent tests were commissioned
OL,11,Fafter mould was treated at a classroom
OL,12,Fat La Mare de Carteret Primary School
OL,13,Fin Cobo in mid-July.
OL,15,FThe States of Guernsey said "no
OL,16,Fsignificant airborne mould" had been
OL,17,Ffound at the school after remedial work
OL,18,Fhad been completed.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,442,440,260,160,0,100
