OL,3,GNEWSAClassroom 'safe to use' after
OL,4,Amould removed
OL,5,
OL,6,FJustin Diamond, head of operations for
OL,7,Fthe States Property Unit, said: "The
OL,8,Fhistoric mould has been treated, a full
OL,9,Fprogramme of remedial works is complete
OL,10,Fand the classroom is safe to use - we
OL,11,Fare confident the issue is resolved."
